    "Tan": "小麦",
    "Deep": "深色",
    "Boss fights are a real battle now: every wave brings 10 monsters, in two rows of five. The waves before the boss are ten of the map's own monsters, and in the last one the boss stands in the middle of the back row, behind nine of its followers. The early waves are weaker to make up for it: the first stands about 13 to 20 levels below the boss and the second 7 to 14 below, while the boss's own followers stay close to its level.": "首领战现在是一场真正的大战了：每一波都有10只怪物，分成两排，每排五只。首领之前的几波是该地图自己的十只怪物；最后一波中，首领站在后排正中间，前面是它的九个手下。作为补偿，前几波会弱一些：第一波比首领低约13到20级，第二波低7到14级，而首领的手下则和它的等级相近。",
    "The world follows the clock now: the light warms at dawn and dusk, and at night the maps sink into deep blue. The sun's glow and its beams fade as it sets and come back in the morning. Caves stay as dark as ever.": "世界现在会跟着时钟变化：黎明和黄昏时光线变得温暖，到了夜晚，地图会沉入深蓝之中。太阳的光晕和光束会随着日落渐渐消失，早上再重新出现。洞窟还是和以前一样黑。",
    "Weather comes and goes, changing every few in-game hours: cloudy skies, rain with ripples on the ground, storms with lightning, banks of fog and snow flurries. Each place has its own: the swamp and the dark woods are often foggy and wet, the desert is nearly always clear, snowy lands get fresh snow and the shores the odd storm.": "天气会随时变化，每隔几个游戏小时就换一次：多云、在地面泛起涟漪的雨、电闪雷鸣的暴风雨、大片的雾和零星的雪花。每个地方都有自己的天气：沼泽和幽暗的树林常常雾气弥漫、潮湿多雨，沙漠几乎总是晴天，雪地会下新雪，海边偶尔有暴风雨。",
    "The game's own notices about sunrise and sunset now say Fairyland, like everywhere else.": "游戏关于日出和日落的通知现在也和其他地方一样写作Fairyland了。",
    "Every skill now has a look of its own. Frost Breath is an icy breath that grows crystals of ice and drifts snow, no longer Bubble's water orb; Bubble sends a stream of bubbles that pop. Ember sprays little embers, Mud Shot lobs a gob that splats, Rock Throw hurls a tumbling boulder, Vine Whip lashes, Golden Spin flings a spinning gold disc, Gust blows streaks of wind, Roar sends out shockwaves, and Web Shot throws webs. Bash slams down from above, Shadow Bite and Venom Bite bite in violet and green, Evil Eye opens a great glaring eye, Poison Mist rolls in as a fog, and Flash bursts into a blinding star.": "现在每个技能都有自己的样子了。冰霜吐息是一口冰冷的气息，会长出冰晶、飘起雪花，不再借用泡泡的水球；泡泡则会喷出一串会破掉的泡泡。火花喷出点点火星，泥巴弹抛出一团啪地溅开的泥，投石扔出一块翻滚的巨石，藤鞭会抽打，黄金旋转甩出一个旋转的金盘，狂风吹出道道风痕，咆哮发出冲击波，蛛网射击会抛出蛛网。猛击从上方重重砸下，暗影咬和毒牙分别以紫色和绿色咬下，邪眼会睁开一只怒视的巨眼，毒雾像浓雾一样滚滚而来，闪光则爆发成一颗耀眼的星星。",
    "Heals and buffs too: First Aid raises a white cross, Recovery a beating heart, Mend Beast paw prints, Blessing a rain of light; Protection forms a shield, Holy Glow an orb of rosy light, Guardianship a dome over the party, Animal Training paw prints and speed lines, Boost rising arrows and Berserk red flames.": "治疗和增益技能也一样：急救会升起白色十字，恢复术是一颗跳动的心，治疗宠物是一串爪印，祝福是一场光之雨；守护术形成一面盾牌，圣光是一团玫瑰色的光球，守护之誓是笼罩全队的光罩，驯兽训练是爪印和速度线，激励是上升的箭头，狂暴则是红色火焰。",
    "Friends no longer copy you. They weigh every move: a plain blow to finish off a monster rather than spending MP, a sweep when there's a crowd, a spell where it hits a weak spot and never where it's resisted, their best skill on the toughest monster, a heal or a buff when it pays, and MP kept back if they're the healer. They rarely use the skill you just used, and on Auto you fight the same thoughtful way.": "好友不再模仿你了。他们会仔细考虑每一步：收尾时用普通攻击而不浪费MP，敌人多时用范围攻击，法术只打弱点、绝不打被抵抗的对象，最强的技能留给最难缠的怪物，划算时才治疗或加增益，如果是治疗者还会留着MP。他们很少使用你刚用过的技能；开启自动战斗时，你也会以同样聪明的方式战斗。",
    "In battle, your line and the monsters' are spaced alike: five of yours stand exactly as far apart as five monsters, and every other line in the fight follows the same spacing. It's the widest that still fits the most crowded line, a companion at its end included.": "战斗中，你方和怪物的队列间距现在一致了：你方五人之间的距离和五只怪物完全相同，战斗中的其他队列也采用同样的间距。这个间距是在能容下最拥挤队列（包括末尾的伙伴）的前提下最宽的。",
    "New spells raise stats for a while: Protection for Fighters (an ally's DEF +40%, from level 12), Holy Glow (an ally's MAG +30%, level 40) and Guardianship (the whole party's DEF +20%, level 60) for Mages, and Animal Training for Beast Tamers (ATK +20% and SPD +30%, level 25). They grow stronger with their skill level, and Bless now raises ATK and DEF the same way.": "新增可暂时提升属性的法术：战士的守护术（一名队友防御+40%，12级起），法师的圣光（一名队友魔力+30%，40级）和守护之誓（全队防御+20%，60级），以及驯兽师的驯兽训练（攻击+20%、速度+30%，25级）。它们会随技能等级变强，祝福现在也以同样的方式提升攻击和防御。",
    "Whenever a spell raises or lowers a stat, the fighter shows which and by how much (\"DEF +40%\" in blue, \"ATK −20%\" in violet), and an arrow by their HP bar counts the rounds it has left.": "每当法术提升或降低属性时，角色身上会显示是哪项属性、变化多少（蓝色的“防御 +40%”、紫色的“攻击 −20%”），HP条旁的箭头会显示剩余回合数。",
    "A curse now lowers ATK and MAG, shown on the cursed fighter, and poison's bite each round is marked \"Poison\" so you can see what took the HP.": "诅咒现在会降低攻击和魔力，并显示在被诅咒的角色身上；每回合的中毒伤害会标上“中毒”，让你看清HP是被什么扣掉的。",
    "Some monsters power themselves up now: golden hamsters, wood hogs, red bulls and earth lions Boost their ATK, and werewolves, fire bears and black kongs go Berserk (more ATK, less DEF). Companions of those kinds do it for you, and friends cast their buffs on whoever they'd help most.": "有些怪物现在会给自己加强了：金仓鼠、木猪、红牛和大地狮会用激励提升攻击，狼人、火熊和黑金刚会进入狂暴（攻击提高、防御降低）。这些种类的伙伴也会为你这样做，好友则会把增益施放给最需要的人。",
    "When a friend or your companion goes up a level with a win, light pours down on them on the field with \"LEVEL UP!\", and the victory card lists them. Friends now keep pace in the same win you level up in, if they were still standing.": "当好友或你的伙伴在胜利后升级时，战场上会有光芒洒落在他们身上，并显示“升级！”，胜利卡片上也会列出他们。现在只要好友还站着，就会在你升级的同一场胜利中一起升级。",
    "What's new: only the newest release is open; tap any other to read it.": "更新内容：只展开最新版本；点击其他版本即可阅读。",
    "When you talk to someone, the window's tail is part of the bubble now: the glass and the light-blue border run out round it, where it used to be a dark triangle stuck over the border. It points at the speaker's face instead of their chest.": "和别人交谈时，对话框的尖角现在是气泡的一部分了：玻璃质感和浅蓝色边框会一直延伸包住它，而以前只是一个贴在边框上的深色三角形。尖角现在指向说话者的脸，而不是胸口。",
    "The elemental spells are drawn in light and colour like the rest of the battle's effects, no more pixel art, and each glows in its own element's colours: Fire Bolt and Ember are a blazing orange fireball that bursts into flame, Jelly Splash, Bubble and Frost Breath a blue orb that splashes into a crown of droplets, Leaf Storm and Vine Whip a cyclone of green light, and Stone Spike, Mud Shot and Rock Throw shards of ochre light bursting out of glowing ground.": "元素法术现在和其他战斗特效一样用光与色彩绘制，不再是像素画，并且各自发出所属元素的颜色：火焰箭和火花是一颗炽热的橙色火球，炸开成一片火焰；果冻飞溅、泡泡和冰霜吐息是一颗蓝色水球，溅开成一圈水花；落叶风暴和藤鞭是一股绿色光旋风；岩石尖刺、泥巴弹和投石则是从发光的地面迸出的赭色光片。",
